## ❓ COMMON QUESTIONS

**Q: Where do I start?**  
A: Investigation Room. Look for the printed report.

**Q: What am I looking for?**  
A: Differences between the printed report and the digital database.

**Q: How will I know when I find it?**  
A: The pattern will become clear. You'll recognize the message.

**Q: How long will this take?**  
A: 30-45 minutes typically. Take your time.

**Q: What if we get stuck?**  
A: Ask the Game Master. Hints are available.

